{"title":"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/a/c5a077d01ae869db2be8f6cd2818726719231512.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[(\\frac{2017 + 2017}{2017})^{-1} + (\\frac{2018}{2018 + 2018})^{-1}]^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"314\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/3114c498347c6f4df0b008818eecd5311dbce30f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[(\\frac{2017 + 2017}{2017})^{-1} + (\\frac{2018}{2018 + 2018})^{-1}]^{-1} = [(\\frac{2017 \\times 2}{2017}^{-1} + (\\frac{2018}{2018 \\times 2})^{-1}]^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"588\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa577b107d4c7160e856206479240179912395b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=[(2)^{-1} + (\\frac{1}{2})^{-1}]^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/6/f566c8a635906967d522572de7e2f249d0b69725.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=[\\frac{1}{2} + 2]^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"93\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/d/fada212903c0cd8a95b71fc16aa0780674e6e47e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=[\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{4}{2}]^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cf9bb578d28b9289bd697ad92dc913ab7a0ede.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=[\\frac{4 + 1}{2}]^{-1} = [\\frac{5}{2}]^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"159\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/0/3a0060f12cbccaf4279d8cb93cf21ffee8b91b26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\frac{2}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"45\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC\">2017 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Team Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Team Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n